# Final Principle

A powerful fighter does not generate force with the arms alone.

Power originates from the ground,

travels through the legs,

is amplified by the trunk,

and is finally expressed through the limbs.

The core is the bridge that connects every movement.

A stronger bridge creates a stronger athlete.